00:18:59.384 --> 00:19:02.066
So let's talk more about the interview.

00:19:02.066 --> 00:19:06.821
Tell me about a time when this is
really the core question kind of

00:19:06.821 --> 00:19:12.391
the fundamental basis of the behavioral
based interview has performance

00:19:12.391 --> 00:19:17.356
as a great indicator for
